OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Fremaining showers will clear this
OL,7,Fevening, leaving it dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells. Cloud will increase again
OL,9,Fovernight, bringing a few further
OL,10,Flight showers later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells, although a few
OL,14,Flight showers are possible, mainly
OL,15,Fduring the morning. Winds will be
OL,16,Fgentle to moderate.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
