OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure will maintain largely dry and
OL,7,Fsettled conditions with a good deal of
OL,8,Fsunshine, though cloud may become more
OL,9,Fextensive on Tuesday.
